 and put people to work to satisfy the demands of King Olaf Tryggvason.\nRefine enough resources to satisfy him, or face the consequences.\n\nThere is always something to do. Forage for resources to upgrade your workers. Some are more rare than others.\nMushrooms give temporary benefits, but the long lasting benefits come from making better food types.\n\nLive through winters, and feast when you have surplus. You never know when you will need the energy.\nSome day you might be powerful enough to fight back.", "summary": "A Viking colony sim with production chains and resource management. Establish a Norse village and refine the land's resources. Pay tribute to the King, or grow strong enough to fight back.", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 22, "name": "Historical"}, {"id": 33, "name": "Sandbox"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/fjordal", "videos": [{"id": 195179, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "3dcVAGt2KqM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3dcVAGt2KqM", "title": "Fjordal | Official Announcement Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/3dcVAGt2KqM/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}